<title>GERMANY: Deutsche MG ups Thyssen to overweight.</title>
<headline>Deutsche MG ups Thyssen to overweight.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell raised its recommendation for German steel company Thyssen AG to overweight from neutral, the investment house said on Monday.</p>
<p>Deutsche MG also said it expected Thyssen's share price to climb to around 400 marks over the next year or two from 328.00 marks now.</p>
<p>Thyssen's successful restructuring was behind the upgrade, Deutsche MG said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
